Four rocket engines roar with pinkish-white flames; white exhaust plumes surge from cylindrical engines.

AD003
00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:21.870
Bright vertical beam shines from industrial complex center.

AD004
00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:47.080
Caption: Forty years later.

AD005
00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:59.670
Simulation ready. Older man examines brain model with robotic arm and glowing arcs.

AD006
00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:05.540
Title: TEARS OF STEEL appears centered on black screen.

AD007
