Massive mechanical structure looms over smoky cityscape.

AD008
00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:17.750
Candles flicker as a person rests on the floor near a window.

AD009
00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:20.690
Robotist creates killer robots

AD010
00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:24.810
Sniper holds rifle steady, laser sight glowing.

AD011
00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:30.740
A large, floating mechanical vehicle hovers in misty blue light through a circular viewport.

AD012
00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:34.610
